  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Aaseya Order Management Solution",
    "splashDescription": "The Aaseya Order Management Solution (AOMS) is designed to streamline telecom order management, eliminating delays, errors, and customer frustration. Built on Camunda, it addresses common industry challenges such as manual tasks, siloed data, and complex workflows. AOMS automates processes, enhances real-time visibility, and improves the customer experience.\n\nKey features include automated order approvals, resource management, and simplified customer onboarding. This solution ensures faster turnaround times, unwavering accuracy, and enhanced customer satisfaction through clear communication and efficient order processing.\n\nTo improve your telecom order management, consider AOMS for its reliable, automated, and customer-focused approach. Contact us to discover how AOMS can transform your operations.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/440239/overview/img5346305550680538212.png?9d8e1714e9220096d767b671ba60c639",
